OL,3,AUS-Canada trade war escalates as Trump
OL,4,Athreatens tariff hike on autos after
OL,5,ACarney vows to retaliate
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump has threatened
OL,8,Fto hike US tariffs on automobiles
OL,9,Foriginating in Canada, as the trade war
OL,10,Fbetween the two neighbours continues to
OL,11,Fheat up.
OL,13,FTrump said on Monday that he will
OL,14,Fincrease tariffs on Canadian cars and
OL,15,Ftrucks, as well as auto parts, from 25%
OL,16,Fto 50% as of 1 January.
OL,18,FIt comes after US-Canada trade talks
OL,19,Fcollapsed late last week, with each
OL,20,Fside accusing the other of making
OL,21,Funreasonable last-minute demands.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
