OL,3,AUS-Canada trade war escalates as Trump
OL,4,Athreatens tariff hike on autos after
OL,5,ACarney vows to retaliate
OL,6,
OL,7,FLate on Monday, Canada officials
OL,8,Fannounced a news conference on Tuesday
OL,9,Fwhere they would outline how the
OL,10,Fcountry would respond to the trade war
OL,11,Fand work to "protect and support
OL,12,FCanadian workers and businesses during
OL,13,Fthese challenging times".
